<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="KCgpZ" id="KCgpZ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4dac800f" id="u4dac800f">📡</span><span data-lake-id="u638952a4" id="u638952a4"> 𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐜𝐤 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧: 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐩𝐨𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐁𝐞𝐭𝐰𝐞𝐞𝐧 𝐀𝐮𝐭𝐨𝐫𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ud7a79070" id="ud7a79070"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a7d3d69" id="u8a7d3d69">与自回归模型相比，扩散模型具有加速生成过程、提高模型输出可控性的潜力。目前，离散扩散模型至少面临三项局限</span></strong></p><ul list="u720a03bb"><li fid="u5b0f3ac1" data-lake-id="uc1fd650c" id="uc1fd650c"><span data-lake-id="ub9693fca" id="ub9693fca">首先，在聊天系统等应用中，模型必须能够生成任意长度的输出序列，例如对用户问题的回答。然而，近期大多数扩散架构只能生成固定长度的向量</span></li><li fid="u5b0f3ac1" data-lake-id="u4037fa8a" id="u4037fa8a"><span data-lake-id="ue6d5a9fe" id="ue6d5a9fe">其次，离散扩散在生成过程中使用双向上下文，因此无法通过 KV 缓存复用此前的计算结果，导致推理效率较低</span></li><li fid="u5b0f3ac1" data-lake-id="u0d374939" id="u0d374939"><span data-lake-id="ufe4bc03c" id="ufe4bc03c">最后，以困惑度等标准指标衡量时，离散扩散模型的质量仍落后于自回归方法，进一步限制其适用性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc6eb82ef" id="uc6eb82ef"><strong><span data-lake-id="u93dd9129" id="u93dd9129">本文提出块离散去噪扩散语言模型，在解决上述局限方面取得进展。这类模型在离散扩散模型与自回归模型之间进行插值</span></strong></p><ul list="u56f4c21b"><li fid="u577fc169" data-lake-id="u1caa03b3" id="u1caa03b3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e246575" id="u0e246575" style="color: #DF2A3F">具体而言，块扩散模型亦称半自回归模型，它在由离散随机变量组成的块之间定义自回归概率分布；在给定先前各块的条件下，当前块的条件概率则由离散去噪扩散模型刻画</span></strong></li><li fid="u577fc169" data-lake-id="u76e61489" id="u76e61489"><span data-lake-id="u5be5f9a9" id="u5be5f9a9">构建有效的 BD3-LMs 面临两个挑战。首先，仅通过神经网络的一次标准前向传播，无法高效计算块扩散模型的训练目标，因此需要开发专门的算法。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u06399fb5" id="u06399fb5" style="color: #5C0036">其次，扩散目标的梯度方差较高，阻碍模型训练，导致 BD3-LMs 即使在块大小为 1 时，表现仍不及自回归模型，而此时两类模型本应等价</span></strong></li><li fid="u577fc169" data-lake-id="u44f61d53" id="u44f61d53"><span data-lake-id="uc3f0ac02" id="uc3f0ac02">推导梯度方差的估计量，并表明，梯度方差是造成自回归模型与扩散模型之间困惑度差距的一个关键因素。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u68a0322f" id="u68a0322f" style="color: #5C0036">随后，提出专门设计的噪声过程，以最小化梯度方差，并在缩小这一困惑度差距方面取得进展</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2a945b0a" id="u2a945b0a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u24359153" id="u24359153">与在嵌入空间中执行高斯扩散的其他半自回归形式相比，BD3-LMs 支持可计算的似然估计，并且能够在生成步数减少一个数量级的情况下，生成具有更优生成困惑度的样本。综上，本文的主要贡献如下：</span></strong></p><ul list="u4e0fead9"><li fid="u8e9d36d8" data-lake-id="ufb16250f" id="ufb16250f"><span data-lake-id="ud3fac22d" id="ud3fac22d">提出块离散扩散语言模型，在词元块之间采用自回归建模，而每个块的条件分布则基于离散扩散。与先前扩散模型不同，块扩散支持变长生成和 KV 缓存</span></li><li fid="u8e9d36d8" data-lake-id="ubddc7530" id="ubddc7530"><span data-lake-id="u03cebc29" id="u03cebc29">提出针对块扩散模型的专用训练算法，能够高效利用输入模型的整个批次中的全部词元。发现梯度方差是限制扩散模型性能的一个因素，并提出专门设计的数据驱动噪声调度，以降低梯度方差</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5ca54527" id="u5ca54527" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791345051063-72354f4e-b5c2-4e3d-a23e-295572cb938c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uadf6af29-f8dc-4979-8650-1f44a5ffc89%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u240b93a3-2097-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A900.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A360%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A170516%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1223%2C%22originHeight%22%3A489%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEREARETHREECATEGORIESOFTHEAVERAGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A79%2C%22width%22%3A459%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VETHELAWWIL1CONTINUETOREDUCETHEDEFICIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A437%2C%22y%22%3A280%2C%22width%22%3A512%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEREARETHREECATEGORIESOFTHEAVERAGERATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A531%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEREARETHREECATEGORIESOFTHEAVERAGERATEOF...%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A129%2C%22width%22%3A583%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E1AWWIL1CONTINUETOREDUCETH%22%2C%22x%22%3A489%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A368%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REPEA1THEREUSABILITYCUTSANDPROVETHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A465%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222016%2CWEWI11BEGIVINGTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A231%2C%22y%22%3A408%2C%22width%22%3A328%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REPEA1THEREUSABI1ITYCUTSAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A339%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22016%2CWEWIL1BEAIVINGTHEBETA-RELEASEOFTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A248%2C%22y%22%3A433%2C%22width%22%3A516%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FIXED-LENGTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A558%2C%22y%22%3A181%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKDIFFUSION(OURS%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A270%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONSEPTEMBER172016WE%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A435%2C%22width%22%3A277%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NOKVCACHING%22%2C%22x%22%3A767%2C%22y%22%3A180%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HIGHQUALITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A381%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARALLELIZABLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1027%2C%22y%22%3A337%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RBITRARY-LENGTL%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WILICONTINUETOTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A552%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A323%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NOTPARALLELIZABLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1023%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A192%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOWERGUALITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A374%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GENERATIONSTEPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONSEPTEMBER17%2C2016%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A409%2C%22width%22%3A244%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEREUSABI1ITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A242%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AUTOREGRESSION%22%2C%22x%22%3A22%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A187%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CACHING%22%2C%22x%22%3A828%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DIFUSION%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARBITRARY-LENGTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A584%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARALLELIZABLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1027%2C%22y%22%3A180%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONSEPTEMBER17%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A195%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOOURSERVER%22%2C%22x%22%3A826%2C%22y%22%3A435%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KVCACHING%22%2C%22x%22%3A808%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IGHQUALITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A385%2C%22y%22%3A342%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THERELEASEOF%22%2C%22x%22%3A490%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A240%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ESTING%22%2C%22x%22%3A1031%2C%22y%22%3A435%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BE%22%2C%22x%22%3A375%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E%22%2C%22x%22%3A265%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf8f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud944e05d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="TyLgL" id="TyLgL" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9746441a" id="u9746441a">💻</span><span data-lake-id="ucda6a6b7" id="ucda6a6b7"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝: 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐢𝐠𝐦𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uc105d876" id="uc105d876"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9311bd3c" id="u9311bd3c">​</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue329bf52" id="ue329bf52">将具有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qr5db%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u785c39e3" id="u785c39e3">个类别的标量离散随机变量，表示为空间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%3D%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C1%5C%5C%7D%5E%7BV%7D%3A%5C%5Csum_i%20x_i%3D1%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Csubset%5C%5CDelta%5E%7BV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F519729c511914d3c1e89b7556f8739ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BXjaN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d881cca" id="u0d881cca">中的独热列向量，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5E%7BV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b33787f1887698386894ab0bec5bf3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CcjNN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1350b48d" id="u1350b48d">表示概率单纯形</span></p><ul list="u4261b84b"><li fid="u11edd9d1" data-lake-id="u2895fe0d" id="u2895fe0d"><span data-lake-id="u6bb1eec2" id="u6bb1eec2">第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qq8Nz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2cf40f62" id="u2cf40f62">个类别对应特殊的</span><code data-lake-id="ubb5cb339" id="ubb5cb339"><span data-lake-id="u309c056f" id="u309c056f">[MASK]</span></code><span data-lake-id="uf6156735" id="uf6156735">词元，其独热向量记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F346d6499785441f0139098ec3e41eefb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xLjub%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u11edd9d1" data-lake-id="u1a4ca547" id="u1a4ca547"><span data-lake-id="u22ef5d4b" id="u22ef5d4b">用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B1%3AL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff7f331fc307cd33202c71b496488fde8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q5mEk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a26dcbd" id="u9a26dcbd">表示由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bcQuy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubbda95bf" id="ubbda95bf">个词元构成的序列，对于所有位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe539a5a1bbd3be6bc9d830e7df0656df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yGi4t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u371b3f60" id="u371b3f60">，均有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F061b394c5402b7a25c0046cc5835e83a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oNWoC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub095526b" id="ub095526b">；用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%5E%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba8282932ce69f0b7335e93b6d83956b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SdMD7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u92840064" id="u92840064">表示所有此类序列构成的集合。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bp%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe53dc55e5875c816cfe59f33897d7bff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xFPdC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ad78e05" id="u0ad78e05">表示概率向量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bp%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5CDelta%5E%7BV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff76457ef4df4a2a33b40323ebe6d4cf2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EcgIe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u196620d2" id="u196620d2">的类别分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u247b17bc" id="u247b17bc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u97d54784" id="u97d54784">自回归模型：考虑从数据分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb54b84e7fc601d8a12d7616a2f855308.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ml3k2%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u09e971c9" id="u09e971c9">中抽取的、由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YrJM3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u93652c6a" id="u93652c6a">个词元构成的序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3D%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff1d8d01b3e7c0f019e8f2000542b92ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TFlNe%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua69c655e" id="ua69c655e">。自回归模型定义如下形式的因子分解分布</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u394e13f5" id="u394e13f5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7B%5C%5Cell%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3C%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93d2d213f234f58dd490fcd18170980e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XXeRZ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud72f9eae"><li fid="ud6b48ea3" data-lake-id="u44479f7f" id="u44479f7f"><span data-lake-id="ue085a717" id="ue085a717">其中，每个条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3C%5C%5Cell%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F237e9381b40e7c68d0512f860a41f35a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zMzqU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23507d83" id="u23507d83">均由神经网络直接参数化。因此，自回归模型可以通过下一词元预测进行高效训练。然而，由于存在顺序依赖关系，自回归模型生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hnhna%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd0fdc50" id="udd0fdc50">个词元需要执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JsopZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u646c0c9f" id="u646c0c9f">个步骤</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u82fc47d1" id="u82fc47d1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u910946c2" id="u910946c2">离散去噪扩散概率模型：扩散模型通过拟合模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe3983e40257faecef60c3d61f556a537.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BcssL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ffde509" id="u7ffde509">，来逆转前向扰动过程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QmUuK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue24afa5b"><li fid="u0f6f0c9b" data-lake-id="u0480f50b" id="u0480f50b"><span data-lake-id="u95519cdb" id="u95519cdb">该过程从干净数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2adf48e1cf80858f0604d2b51eeed4b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D2A2p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a195a90" id="u1a195a90">出发，对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85d2cfca61ca1cdb1fcd47ce76c4dc4b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wEVDU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua03abdbb" id="ua03abdbb">，定义潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%3D%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7BL%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbbe4ef89dc8f0322e6e148fc412c0392.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CVFVe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5382dac7" id="u5382dac7">，表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2adf48e1cf80858f0604d2b51eeed4b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AZjpE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub269c0c8" id="ub269c0c8">的噪声程度逐渐增大的版本。将这一过程离散化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qS2nm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc2086988" id="uc2086988">个步骤后，定义</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s(j)%3D(j-1)%2FT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84239f1dc69909719d2085d36a97164f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vBJwY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2efdd2e5" id="u2efdd2e5">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t(j)%3Dj%2FT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fad5ddf1bef1d159702ba15cb94236353.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jzgEI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7c387a2" id="uc7c387a2">​</span></li><li fid="u0f6f0c9b" data-lake-id="uc2331146" id="uc2331146"><span data-lake-id="u21c5d1e2" id="u21c5d1e2">D3PM 框架将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iXaYj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud83c2f22" id="ud83c2f22">定义为独立作用于每个词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F267e7b873287e09c49992cf2ef92f3dc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I5Nwh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u305967af" id="u305967af">的马尔可夫前向过程，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32525e7802106a848b63e158bd574ce0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CTSjC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua62135fe" id="ua62135fe">，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BV%5C%5Ctimes%20V%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F504d5a6ff72c7fdb37622a4d9119fca9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nmz3s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a1c2c7c" id="u7a1c2c7c">为扩散矩阵。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a1093d0f9c5ad3440ce6959ea059e34.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SH1iV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue88f27c1" id="ue88f27c1">可以刻画多种变换，包括掩蔽、随机词元替换，以及相关词语替换。理想的扩散模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3f197b904ccc8bce421a3124813852.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GbMmW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e0b72cd" id="u7e0b72cd">是过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wghLM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9558bfc2" id="u9558bfc2">的逆过程。D3PM 框架将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3f197b904ccc8bce421a3124813852.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Clay6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb35fcb5" id="ucb35fcb5">定义为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uadbd06ef" id="uadbd06ef" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7B%5C%5Cell%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cprod_%7B%5C%5Cell%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7Dq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cright)p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F703ed4b9990cfbae35f18d8d9f3f2fb2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QtKv2%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3528dd9b"><li fid="u9a6e4f27" data-lake-id="u72c227d5" id="u72c227d5"><span data-lake-id="u03f9a3a5" id="u03f9a3a5">其中，基础去噪模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1640c4afb47be73eb865455605cfdac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y8rZO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3b8ec78" id="ue3b8ec78">在给定含噪序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce592280caf7d6ba355692d3496b1f7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dTwma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f9a7ba5" id="u6f9a7ba5">的条件下，预测干净词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F267e7b873287e09c49992cf2ef92f3dc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TDWFm%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u9a6e4f27" data-lake-id="u106413ca" id="u106413ca"><span data-lake-id="u1ce2e138" id="u1ce2e138">扩散模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3f197b904ccc8bce421a3124813852.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JK7E3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6086e78" id="ue6086e78">通过变分推断进行训练。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BKL%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff6df72be2604a55de424c2d9cb0149a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w1gge%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua77cd6be" id="ua77cd6be">表示 Kullback–Leibler 散度，则负证据下界为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u64e493c0" id="u64e493c0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7DD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs(j)%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(j)%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bs(j)%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(j)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%2BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Bq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(T)%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(T)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26ed17fc3d992359fa49fc55c9cd23a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zTRB7%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="P4FT5" id="P4FT5" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u11947bd5" id="u11947bd5">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u6c2244fc" id="u6c2244fc"> 𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐜𝐤 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u590251c5" id="u590251c5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub30d97fe" id="ub30d97fe">研究一类块离散去噪扩散语言模型。这类模型通过在词元块之间定义自回归分布，并在每个块内部执行扩散，在自回归模型与扩散模型之间进行插值</span></strong></p><ul list="u007f40ec"><li fid="ufcc2b784" data-lake-id="uc5598abf" id="uc5598abf"><span data-lake-id="ue0ca86ca" id="ue0ca86ca">提出用于最大似然估计的块扩散目标，以及高效的训练和采样算法。表明，当块大小为 1 时，尽管扩散目标在期望意义上等价于自回归似然，但其方差仍然较高。将较高的训练方差识别为扩散模型的一项局限，并提出数据驱动的噪声调度，以降低训练过程中梯度更新的方差</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2768438f" id="u2768438f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6da6212b" id="u6da6212b">块扩散分布与模型架构：在词元块之间进行自回归建模，并在每个块内部执行扩散</span></strong></p><ul list="u125ab586"><li fid="u043af8e5" data-lake-id="u123f6dc1" id="u123f6dc1"><span data-lake-id="ucba901af" id="ucba901af">将序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2adf48e1cf80858f0604d2b51eeed4b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KSQbc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub269d4aa" id="ub269d4aa">中的词元划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54f5fb1b07a88521e7b036e3bc7a5e33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bgzMg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02c88a20" id="u02c88a20">个长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b1fa10ba31200563409e9af5fdbb4e9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SnQrD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u094f02ea" id="u094f02ea">的块，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%3DL%2FL%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dc72da59575fbde98dae89d20c25c18.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p0pTb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u647ead4a" id="u647ead4a">，并假设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54f5fb1b07a88521e7b036e3bc7a5e33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AtBBQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucab08cf3" id="ucab08cf3">为整数。对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CB%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb14ba1f3f06e16b941b39118bc5ac357.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RxYk1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc35b154d" id="uc35b154d">，将位置从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(b-1)L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99e6b9d0406e915611286c0184ed7875.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xeUPi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1edaa2d0" id="u1edaa2d0">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22bL%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40caa59dd24e7a6be8146de32f210e45.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IwHq1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3bcecb4" id="ue3bcecb4">的词元块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(b-1)L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%3AbL%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd95579c5136df4dc0838e0f4d86e723.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dYHmc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd9e92f9" id="ubd9e92f9">记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe48b8ffa6413a36e45860d20ccf8f713.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pptTG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15f0d0e3" id="u15f0d0e3">。模型的对数似然按块分解为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u40bf9902" id="u40bf9902" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd15e512aee9fb3d42c0386e832b91d9b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FHyZW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud84bd533"><li fid="u1e69d900" data-lake-id="u44e60820" id="u44e60820"><span data-lake-id="u4a2bc006" id="u4a2bc006">每个条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F815adb4d7aeb4ba46fa1c9b803ffb27e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FWaPL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub652dded" id="ub652dded">均通过在包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b1fa10ba31200563409e9af5fdbb4e9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xE28O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41cd3794" id="u41cd3794">个词元的块上执行离散扩散来建模。定义一个与式（2）类似、但仅作用于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BREyq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fd93cca" id="u8fd93cca">个块的逆向扩散过程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua25ce0d0" id="ua25ce0d0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Csum_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%7Dq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cright)p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d2f68ea6a72384cd2cefec509d0d504.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JyfSw%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u80bcc3d8"><li fid="ue2b16f82" data-lake-id="ube02b8f6" id="ube02b8f6"><span data-lake-id="u9ad97879" id="u9ad97879">将式（3）中的负证据下界（NELBO）分别应用于式（4）的各项，即可得到一个具有理论依据的学习目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u36a9b433" id="u36a9b433" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1acaf48acf7301eef5f5127395d97a12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nCsOM%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="udf56b28d"><li fid="u02f9ba2f" data-lake-id="u4db07771" id="u4db07771"><span data-lake-id="u4e70cc80" id="u4e70cc80">其中，每个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67ed947064cf440d5d8112a726c43118.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DJZkn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77243ce0" id="u77243ce0"> 都是将式（3）应用于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9687ffa2858b2378d1b047dab4589267.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D7F2R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4806583d" id="u4806583d">所得到的实例。由于模型以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cdeb3672f25c9d8f767f66fb046de7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DlKEL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u079da78b" id="u079da78b">为条件，在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b4abab2d4d67001988fb0235d36fcd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dWvkh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9ef98f90" id="u9ef98f90">中显式标明其对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cdeb3672f25c9d8f767f66fb046de7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q8tAh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc2bc332" id="ucc2bc332">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KlSds%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u147727c2" id="u147727c2">的依赖。将这些项的总和记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c20bda35f2a419218f5d7ecfb0169b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yxcsa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue2ae7d45" id="ue2ae7d45">，它本身也是一个有效的负证据下界</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u367f187c" id="u367f187c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u817b6120" id="u817b6120">模型架构：使用单个神经网络</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qmJrT%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc36f9fc" id="ucc36f9fc">，对这</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54f5fb1b07a88521e7b036e3bc7a5e33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jLdEU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c8fff2f" id="u6c8fff2f">个基础去噪模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd84b9be9b5ea2d36e8cb97afb08e350c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NTbVC%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5110526" id="ud5110526">进行参数化。神经网络</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r1w1A%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6637f776" id="u6637f776">不仅输出概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd84b9be9b5ea2d36e8cb97afb08e350c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zYXJz%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f2ca860" id="u8f2ca860">，还输出用于高效训练的中间计算结果。这使能够以节省内存的方式，并行计算全部</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54f5fb1b07a88521e7b036e3bc7a5e33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zmi3j%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u129db491" id="u129db491">个块的损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c20bda35f2a419218f5d7ecfb0169b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mfKnv%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4602f423"><li fid="ub04942ee" data-lake-id="ufbf2a905" id="ufbf2a905"><span data-lake-id="uce075912" id="uce075912">使用带有块因果注意力掩码的 Transformer 来参数化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kbqFG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64a6fe82" id="u64a6fe82">。该 Transformer 处理</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kIWnD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u388d5b1f" id="u388d5b1f">个词元，其中，第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nr2pC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cb21e79" id="u1cb21e79">个块中的词元可以关注第 1 至第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VtBCq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua308670a" id="ua308670a">个块中的词元。训练得到的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc35d2efaacdee51a43998432c1ea1de4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U3DQi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20bed547" id="u20bed547">根据含噪块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F097fe8a671f42489a1afe212a4c389ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AGYOA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01b10322" id="u01b10322">和干净的历史块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cdeb3672f25c9d8f767f66fb046de7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UZuT2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab8c10de" id="uab8c10de">，输出第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JeeSw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d30df96" id="u4d30df96">个块中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b1fa10ba31200563409e9af5fdbb4e9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ovfBc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d76dda8" id="u1d76dda8">个词元的去噪预测</span></li><li fid="ub04942ee" data-lake-id="u2b887485" id="u2b887485"><span data-lake-id="ue19ee9a5" id="ue19ee9a5">在自回归生成中，通常会缓存此前已生成词元的键和值，以避免每一步都重新计算。类似地，用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F330a7b00a781d16d3b79198cd4c28ab8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hyi3H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueed6e7c4" id="ueed6e7c4">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3b5b839c451d85ef6743159c8a41acc5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YUtkG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97530ec9" id="u97530ec9">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sm66E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3ed3521" id="ud3ed3521">个块的键和值，并使</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mLXuk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaaf3be3a" id="uaaf3be3a">支持将它们作为输入和输出。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LT2T9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57b72806" id="u57b72806">的完整输入输出接口为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue52df0aa" id="ue52df0aa" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogits%7D%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F603c432ff1f2208fa116745b7b0695d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tsgsx%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u99beeba4"><li fid="u3d440fb5" data-lake-id="u0aa909fe" id="u0aa909fe"><span data-lake-id="ud2a8bf21" id="ud2a8bf21">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blogits%7D%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcfe37cc57e885192c2d055b72bd38108.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dCf3q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7c11f3b" id="uc7c11f3b">是对干净块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe48b8ffa6413a36e45860d20ccf8f713.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hWMyd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd3009ff" id="ubd3009ff">的预测，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F330a7b00a781d16d3b79198cd4c28ab8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KW2cb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d562ffd" id="u3d562ffd">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3b5b839c451d85ef6743159c8a41acc5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U671O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf884931c" id="uf884931c">是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8WhA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue31f8bd6" id="ue31f8bd6">前向传播过程中产生的键值缓存；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F71cffa9644396cfa783c8a2aab6a6cd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kpHyC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubab7329c" id="ubab7329c">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F312323c9cf809117a91efe37a55d05a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zEKoi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u007428dd" id="u007428dd">则是在对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cdeb3672f25c9d8f767f66fb046de7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WkmKy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffe29944" id="uffe29944">执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cgvub%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a1ff004" id="u1a1ff004">的前向传播时缓存的键和值。因此，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cdeb3672f25c9d8f767f66fb046de7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h48Rg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u426fc850" id="u426fc850">为输入，与以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F71cffa9644396cfa783c8a2aab6a6cd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HUGfB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e2d3a7b" id="u5e2d3a7b">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F312323c9cf809117a91efe37a55d05a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TWLxt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e54e897" id="u1e54e897">为输入是等价的</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9b302d83" id="u9b302d83"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0dba0a9f" id="u0dba0a9f">高效训练与采样算法：理想情况下，希望仅通过</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O2dir%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u35b58474" id="u35b58474">的一次前向传播，就计算出损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c20bda35f2a419218f5d7ecfb0169b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oLMbT%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u476ea095" id="u476ea095">。然而，对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F097fe8a671f42489a1afe212a4c389ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22medlO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u46f57c8f" id="u46f57c8f">进行去噪，需要以这一含噪输入执行一次前向传播；而对后续块进行去噪，则需要在该块的干净版本</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe48b8ffa6413a36e45860d20ccf8f713.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oqLcU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf04e2a6" id="ubf04e2a6">上运行</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sr86w%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb9f7c59" id="ueb9f7c59">。因此，每个块都必须至少经过模型两次</span></strong></p><ul list="ube24f1e9"><li fid="u82be4236" data-lake-id="u7e573209" id="u7e573209"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub26c4996" id="ub26c4996">训练：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uefa48a9d" id="uefa48a9d">基于这一观察，提出满足上述最低计算需求的训练算法。具体而言，首先对完整序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2adf48e1cf80858f0604d2b51eeed4b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nsxz7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21b8507d" id="u21b8507d">执行一次前向传播，预先计算键和值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F31c66cc5ef7218fd0e0d6529bab81412.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W4YX5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28b4ef41" id="u28b4ef41">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa537bdca9a1cbcb926b44961b89c3f9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wfEA5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48e33634" id="u48e33634">，即 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cvarnothing%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3AB%7D)%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa76a0e5a17c8d2b1d5ac81f0667f54a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ft1WB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub21ab7cc" id="ub21ab7cc">。随后，使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0a0f4e6723aca3351421882c1bb155f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mIbsz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33c00881" id="u33c00881">计算所有块的去噪预测。每个词元经过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f3030a8ec3568dcad420ddcaa7f49e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TVlsz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57c4d505" id="u57c4d505">两次</span></li><li fid="u82be4236" data-lake-id="u56854de0" id="u56854de0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u556cbedf" id="u556cbedf">向量化训练：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50f41b0c" id="u50f41b0c">一种朴素实现是循环</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54f5fb1b07a88521e7b036e3bc7a5e33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MHBBQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a45c27d" id="u8a45c27d">次，分别调用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0a0f4e6723aca3351421882c1bb155f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EXFyH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4460e116" id="u4460e116">来计算 logits。将含噪数据与干净数据拼接为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnoisy%7D%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe56172304e1d8a738cca833ae8d5a7a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Na3fU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a6022a4" id="u3a6022a4">，通过一次前向传播计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c20bda35f2a419218f5d7ecfb0169b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jUFIG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e741b62" id="u1e741b62">。其中，含噪数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnoisy%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_1%7D%5E%7B1%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Ccdots%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_B%7D%5E%7BB%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51212ad627579a509d2e85e8a7c1480f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AWZkw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u27461deb" id="u27461deb">由对每个块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe48b8ffa6413a36e45860d20ccf8f713.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MBzrD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f5d9fd4" id="u4f5d9fd4">分别施加噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb03bb17222c6a3ce023dc9c64ff465dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x3s6J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d454c5e" id="u8d454c5e">得到。为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnoisy%7D%7D%5C%5Coplus%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe56172304e1d8a738cca833ae8d5a7a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wzLoB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc57850d5" id="uc57850d5">设计注意力掩码，使含噪词元能够关注同一块中的其他含噪词元，以及所有先前块中的干净词元</span></li><li fid="u82be4236" data-lake-id="u4033b69e" id="u4033b69e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7023ca29" id="u7023ca29">采样：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u96c41e21" id="u96c41e21">以前面已经采样得到的块为条件，每次采样一个块。可以采用任意采样过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSAMPLE%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4dea6fc69e88d248e2ff54c3d0e6378f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W5tnd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7be93251" id="u7be93251">，从条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_s%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1eab499c7652b4f77bafa638af7f8c76.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xl702%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucab339c8" id="ucab339c8">中采样。其中，通过与预先计算的键和值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F71cffa9644396cfa783c8a2aab6a6cd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xxvoA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d3ec240" id="u7d3ec240">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B1%3Ab-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F312323c9cf809117a91efe37a55d05a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CLoKq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a73d010" id="u4a73d010">执行交叉注意力，实现上下文条件化。与自回归模型类似，缓存键和值可以避免在采样新块时重新计算这些结果，从而节省计算。值得注意的是，块扩散解码算法能够采样生成任意长度的序列，而扩散模型通常受限于固定长度生成。此外，的采样器支持在每个块内部并行生成，而自回归采样器只能逐词元生成</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6860152a" id="u6860152a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791346222922-729d418b-6cb0-406d-9e76-7bf1924cc8eb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udd2d2a21-76ee-4ae8-a190-b3dbbb434f0%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u81768c4d-5610-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A978%2C%22height%22%3A391%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A197901%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1223%2C%22originHeight%22%3A489%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22VB%3AX%2C0%2C0%E4%B8%80X2(X.%2CK1%3A61%2CV1%3A61)%22%2C%22x%22%3A98%2C%22y%22%3A278%2C%22width%22%3A500%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KP%2CVIPXE(X)BKVCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A98%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A500%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%3A%23BLOCKSB%2CMODELXE%2CDIFFUSIONSAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A650%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A537%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUT%3ADATAPOINTX%2C%23OFBLOCKSB%2CFORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A534%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGORITHM1BLOCKDIFFUSIONTRAINING%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A454%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226E1%2C..%2CB%3AXG%2C~(X)%22%2C%22x%22%3A100%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A394%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XSAMPLE(X..K1B-1%2CVIB-1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A672%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A438%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGORITHM2BLOCKDIFFUSIONSAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A626%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A467%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NOISEPROCESSGT(X)%2CMODELXE%2CLOSSLBD%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A111%2C%22width%22%3A492%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPT%26KVCA%22%2C%22x%22%3A804%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A334%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLET%2C...%2CTB~U0%2CL%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A356%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAKEGRADIENTSTEPONVELBD(XIOGIT%3B0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A100%2C%22y%22%3A355%2C%22width%22%3A454%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(K%2CV)(KLB-0K.VIB-1AV%22%2C%22x%22%3A690%2C%22y%22%3A326%2C%22width%22%3A466%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LETXLOGIT%E4%B8%80XOGIFXIOGI%22%2C%22x%22%3A104%2C%22y%22%3A317%2C%22width%22%3A371%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORB%3D1TOBD0%22%2C%22x%22%3A644%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A242%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PLINGALGORITHMSAMPLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A650%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A290%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%2CK%5C%22%2CV0%E4%B8%80X6)%22%2C%22x%22%3A691%2C%22y%22%3A261%2C%22width%22%3A286%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%E4%B8%80XL%3A0-10X0%22%2C%22x%22%3A692%2C%22y%22%3A294%2C%22width%22%3A299%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETURNX%22%2C%22x%22%3A651%2C%22y%22%3A392%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NTILCONVERGED%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A489%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A646%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REPEAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A187%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C0.8926%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f3f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ueb26ba91%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="I7Z1c" id="I7Z1c" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u649c13d9" id="u649c13d9">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="u22db18ae" id="u22db18ae"> 𝐔𝐧𝐝𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐋𝐢𝐤𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐆𝐚𝐩𝐬 𝐁𝐞𝐭𝐰𝐞𝐞𝐧 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 &amp; 𝐀𝐑 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u6168a14a" id="u6168a14a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud7f9bc69" id="ud7f9bc69">当前最有效的扩散语言模型采用掩蔽加噪过程，在这一过程中，词元被逐步替换为特殊的掩码词元。本节介绍掩蔽式 BD3-LMs，这是一类基于掩蔽扩散语言建模框架的特殊块扩散模型</span></strong></p><ul list="ufe5e36d2"><li fid="u0a717134" data-lake-id="u08038958" id="u08038958"><span data-lake-id="ua05f383c" id="ua05f383c">更形式化地，对于位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe539a5a1bbd3be6bc9d830e7df0656df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h8FY2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e4fe3f3" id="u0e4fe3f3">上的词元，采用逐词元加噪过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCat%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3B%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2B(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24e44066f74fa16a039beb79a0c09c71.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uAj7k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u70dfe5c3" id="u70dfe5c3">，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd853b322b6393e4c6e37904e65d80f11.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p54d8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u638752cc" id="u638752cc">是掩码词元的独热编码，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7dae22ca7d426c764592d7f874990eaa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22amrGW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5167bf9d" id="u5167bf9d">是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wkDUL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01ff5efe" id="u01ff5efe">严格递减的函数，且满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_0%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ca267b0cb3b3dfd9b6542208ad5ea3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JYnTq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud78c2b3d" id="ud78c2b3d">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_1%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff26fa13673e53e8115dea1fc9f8c7db8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ptNGz%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u0a717134" data-lake-id="u0bb5d0e4" id="u0bb5d0e4"><span data-lake-id="u93cda0c2" id="u93cda0c2">采用线性调度，词元在时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aTXP0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u98582ed8" id="u98582ed8">被掩蔽的概率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95121e2d0d733a76ebf8faa87bdb2634.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zir3j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63f2711f" id="u63f2711f">。采用 Sahoo et al.（2024a）、Shi et al.（2024）和 Ou et al.（2025）提出的简化目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1cd54c6e" id="u1cd54c6e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5B0%2C1%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7Bb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7Bb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb823059beffe520ba758f1b9b0380eb2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zrcw1%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf44aa0a1"><li fid="ubeb9ccf0" data-lake-id="u581017e1" id="u581017e1"><span data-lake-id="u8fbb19c0" id="u8fbb19c0">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F88658ce8cea533ddc050116a66522383.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hEtqu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub4d2d640" id="ub4d2d640">表示将式（3）通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%5C%5Crightarrow%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7bd8ae75e762f7555abbc6603d2edf23.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qxZwM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucedb86b9" id="ucedb86b9">推广至连续时间后，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ONT27%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ae9a0aa" id="u8ae9a0aa">的瞬时变化率。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F897dd70b29d1390d982f4732a59d4a56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eYcx5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u042ad7bb" id="u042ad7bb"> 时，负证据下界是紧的；但随着</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Crightarrow%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa530d814224ee699eb5f6616f21bc07f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aSXeC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e7fcb7a" id="u2e7fcb7a">，它对真实负对数似然的近似会变得更加宽松</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7096f678" id="u7096f678"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0d70eb1" id="uf0d70eb1">单词元生成：在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F897dd70b29d1390d982f4732a59d4a56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wcFqs%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u47c9ddc2" id="u47c9ddc2">的极限情况下，的块扩散参数化形式，即式（8），在期望意义上等价于自回归负对数似然，即式（1）。然而，当在 LM1B 数据集上分别训练块大小为 1 的块扩散模型和自回归模型时，发现二者之间仍存在两个困惑度点的差距</span></strong></p><ul list="u6f46ffa3"><li fid="uaf4486f3" data-lake-id="u944716fe" id="u944716fe"><span data-lake-id="u936e2ab5" id="u936e2ab5">尽管这两个目标在期望意义上等价，但表明，剩余的困惑度差距源于较高的训练方差。自回归模型使用全部</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yGzDC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u74e280b4" id="u74e280b4">个词元的交叉熵进行训练，而块大小为 1 的块扩散模型仅对被掩蔽的词元计算交叉熵，即满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a1860d88139e6ed03f808c275020f4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E07em%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7b7c72a6" id="u7b7c72a6">的词元，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe539a5a1bbd3be6bc9d830e7df0656df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fO4EY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua141e845" id="ua141e845">，并且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D%5B0%2C1%5D%7Dq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D0.5%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57f7b0a9900703bb179b2e6abfa7eaab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HDyjw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d6ff455" id="u1d6ff455">。因此，使用扩散目标进行训练时，用于估计损失梯度的词元数量减少一半，这导致其训练方差高于自回归模型</span></li><li fid="uaf4486f3" data-lake-id="ud5a25422" id="ud5a25422"><span data-lake-id="ud2c481fa" id="ud2c481fa">为消除这一似然差距，在训练块大小为 1 的 BD3-LM 时，将前向过程设计为完全掩蔽词元，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bm%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D)%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0778c12ee41fe4f262a8547abbcea7e1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D5tDr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7e89f4a" id="ub7e89f4a">。在这一调度下，扩散目标变为与自回归目标等价</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1da7a10a" id="u1da7a10a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue01d70ef" id="ue01d70ef">高方差训练导致的扩散模型差距：基于对单词元生成的实证观察，提出一个梯度方差估计量，并利用它最小化块大小</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Cgeq1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe558fc11fae3ddd648dcb39c12442138.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cwF9q%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u28d2c727" id="u28d2c727">时扩散模型训练的方差</span></strong></p><ul list="uc1ed89a4"><li fid="ub5ddad84" data-lake-id="u439d231c" id="u439d231c"><span data-lake-id="u9a9d6f09" id="u9a9d6f09">尽管 NELBO 对噪声调度的选择具有不变性，但这一不变性并不适用于训练过程中使用的蒙特卡洛损失估计量。因此，该估计量及其梯度的方差均依赖于噪声调度</span></li><li fid="ub5ddad84" data-lake-id="u2dbb4d56" id="u2dbb4d56"><span data-lake-id="ub7fd1f50" id="ub7fd1f50">首先，给出批量大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rJ2vA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua25bdf45" id="ua25bdf45">时的 NELBO 估计量。将一批序列记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3D%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(K)%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a1fbf89c042b53791af6668d4fa8235.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OlAOx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63caa2da" id="u63caa2da">，其中，各个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(k)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc90fc0eb49775b295b82b305e50f504b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YVwSM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa3e768c" id="ufa3e768c">独立同分布地采样自</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb54b84e7fc601d8a12d7616a2f855308.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qm9Vn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u554d5851" id="u554d5851">。由此得到如下批量 NELBO 估计量，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t(k%2Cb)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc881c572108de696c2e56e77dfc149a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wMag3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uecd8a170" id="uecd8a170">表示为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rpRom%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubadbaa82" id="ubadbaa82">条序列的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JUxZi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u58c78ee9" id="u58c78ee9">个块采样的时间步</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u64e55c4e" id="u64e55c4e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BBD%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3Dl(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BK%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5E%7BK%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bb%3D1%7D%5E%7BB%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt(k%2Cb)%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt(k%2Cb)%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(k)%2Cb%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt(k%2Cb)%7D%5E%7B(k)%2Cb%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(k)%2C%3Cb%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f6b79150015e475747b9e55c029d506.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MfLw9%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uef478204"><li fid="u7513e6cc" data-lake-id="ue72ee852" id="ue72ee852"><span data-lake-id="u81a0d3a3" id="u81a0d3a3">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nEQdV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9cd57f7" id="ua9cd57f7">个批次 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8604de9a50cb516605d0c78b1af33bce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yY8KA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0111c69f" id="u0111c69f">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CM%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90bbcbb333434523e7a7c65cbe0aec5b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zU6pN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c245fe3" id="u3c245fe3">，梯度估计量的方差可估计为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf19574f0" id="uf19574f0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BVar%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20l(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Capprox%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BM-1%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bm%3D1%7D%5E%7BM%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20l(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BM%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bm%3D1%7D%5E%7BM%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20l(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2.%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff65fb8f5643156fdc537a9958dd00581.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mN203%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="YSmBn" id="YSmBn" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uef5e8051" id="uef5e8051">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u381c2ad6" id="u381c2ad6"> 𝐋𝐨𝐰-𝐕𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐍𝐨𝐢𝐬𝐞 𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐞𝐬 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐁𝐃𝟑-𝐋𝐌𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u15c234ab" id="u15c234ab"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9067d64d" id="u9067d64d">避免极端的掩蔽比例：目标是找到能够最小化梯度估计量方差的噪声调度，从而使训练尽可能高效。在掩蔽式建模中，希望随机掩蔽不同数量的词元，使模型学会消除不同程度的噪声，这对于采样过程至关重要</span></strong></p><ul list="u29ba5692"><li fid="ue835e5fc" data-lake-id="u6dcecf07" id="u6dcecf07"><span data-lake-id="u1cce8bce" id="u1cce8bce">如果仅掩蔽极少量词元，重建这些词元就会非常容易，无法提供有价值的学习信号</span></li><li fid="ue835e5fc" data-lake-id="u03751937" id="u03751937"><span data-lake-id="uc37b00d2" id="uc37b00d2">如果将全部词元掩蔽，最优的重建结果则是数据分布中各个词元的边缘分布，这同样容易学习，也无法提供有价值的学习信号。这些极端的掩蔽比例会产生质量较差、方差较高的梯度。因此，希望通过一类简单而有效的新型调度，学习如何截除这些极端情况</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u242f27f1" id="u242f27f1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua4d218ad" id="ua4d218ad">用于低方差梯度的截断调度：提出一类截断（clipped）噪声调度，从均匀分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D%5B%5C%5Cbeta%2C%5C%5Comega%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5f7bf563b228c00ec29634bb51c472a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A0g8C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u020fe070" id="u020fe070">中采样掩蔽比例，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cbeta%2C%5C%5Comega%5C%5Cleq1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F137bed414129988b20280a1355486bc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kmYJD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4f5fd17b"><li fid="ua13b3753" data-lake-id="u553c3080" id="u553c3080"><span data-lake-id="u77056218" id="u77056218">从推导蒙特卡洛梯度估计量的角度来看，这类调度等价于一种连续调度：在指定区间之前，掩蔽概率近似为 0，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Calpha_%7B%3C%5C%5Cbeta%7D%5C%5Capprox%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd04551f0b81cb157c43ace09f89ddc79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T2hyH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a92a6d5" id="u9a92a6d5">；在指定区间之后，掩蔽概率近似为 1，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Calpha_%7B%3E%5C%5Comega%7D%5C%5Capprox1-%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8f1f0d2046a1d2c8662e37e80c3d0cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NyyPX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf56b5e0a" id="uf56b5e0a">。因此，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F88658ce8cea533ddc050116a66522383.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eBWDo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96fad96a" id="u96fad96a">在该区间内是线性的，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Capprox1%2F(%5C%5Cbeta-%5C%5Comega)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc62ca6d819ad59b40013e202a318362c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fdeM8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77c37e36" id="u77c37e36">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u90f8c2b2" id="u90f8c2b2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5965df3f" id="u5965df3f">面向不同块大小的数据驱动截断调度：由于最优掩蔽比例可能随块大小</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b1fa10ba31200563409e9af5fdbb4e9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HhczB%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u59eaf258" id="u59eaf258">而变化，在训练过程中自适应地学习噪声调度</span></strong></p><ul list="ua892775a"><li fid="u7f65229c" data-lake-id="ud4c65674" id="ud4c65674"><span data-lake-id="u4aee29b9" id="u4aee29b9">Kingma et al. 利用其平方形式的扩散损失，分离出方差项并对其进行最小化。然而，这一策略无法直接应用于式（10）中的方差估计量，因为不仅希望降低随机时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb03bb17222c6a3ce023dc9c64ff465dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fej5z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uafca95cf" id="uafca95cf">带来的方差，还希望降低随机批次带来的方差</span></li><li fid="u7f65229c" data-lake-id="ud5e181a4" id="ud5e181a4"><span data-lake-id="ubaf01a8a" id="ubaf01a8a">因此，转而优化参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EiCSk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b4b6f54" id="u0b4b6f54">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F327cab7c761f03df97ad9c71506d0589.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RHhh0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88a82b46" id="u88a82b46">，以直接最小化训练方差。为限制这一优化过程的计算负担，使用扩散 ELBO 估计量的方差，作为梯度估计量方差的代理指标，并据此优化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pFrCp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u919db210" id="u919db210">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F327cab7c761f03df97ad9c71506d0589.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wAKgK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc428fb43" id="uc428fb43">。在训练过程中定期进行网格搜索，以找到最优的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NKFtf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21ba81fb" id="u21ba81fb">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F327cab7c761f03df97ad9c71506d0589.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BpHFM%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufb3c9322" id="ufb3c9322" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Cbeta%2C%5C%5Comega%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BVar%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3B%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cbeta%2C%5C%5Comega)%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd8520cecb8e05067b2e236cfc0973f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jrl9u%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u53fdacc0" id="u53fdacc0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791347003620-debc3be5-3a92-483d-9f87-ef45f2c8d7d6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua5660822-93fd-4531-86b8-5f6f54680f0%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u918cf050-d67c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A871.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A245%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A128561%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1193%2C%22originHeight%22%3A335%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODELSARETRAINEDONLM1BUSINGALINEARSCHEDULEFOR6SBTOKENS%2CTHENFINETUNEDFOR10BTOKENS.%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A1159%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ABLE2%3APERPLEXITIES(PLS%3A)ANDVARIANCESOFTHENELBOVARX%3ACEP(X%3A0)(VARNELBO%3AJ).%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A1165%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2212831.72%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A214%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VARNELBO%22%2C%22x%22%3A2